sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as PULSE app
  participant S as SharePoint
  B->>A: Load index and bundled modules
  A->>S: Detect site and current user
  S-->>A: Session identity and role record
  A->>S: Validate setup and load records
  S-->>A: Lists and library data
  A-->>B: Render shell and current route
